{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You go to bed at night, but wake up in a place where everything feels both familiar and unsettling. You must find a way to escape\u2026 or is it all just a dream?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore over 50+ levels alone or with your friends.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930650/extras/0294c0ae47db0de32b5e6e0fb83ca3f8.avif?t=1755189997\" width=1080 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make last minute decisions</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Should you go left or right? Each path leads to a different possibility of getting out. Will you take your friend with you, or will you both go separate ways?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930650/extras/b2117cc471ead3a0da1dde35dc3baf04.avif?t=1755189997\" width=1484 height=910 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What\u2019s your favorite aesthetic\u2014dreamcore, liminal spaces, or Frutiger Aero?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve created all of them. You can explore liminal places that feel strangely familiar, wander through unsettling dreamcore worlds where something feels off, or step into the Frutiger future we were promised but never received.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3930650?t=1755189997","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930650/d47b74d488b0f231eff86de0b70a6761b1e3f79c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755189997","capsule_image":"https://sh